LICENSE
This repository contains three components with distinct licensing terms:

-----------------------------------------------------------------------
1. SAM-Derivative Components
Includes: Retrained model weights and code derived from Meta's Segment Anything Model (SAM).
License: Apache License 2.0 (full text in Appendix A).
Restrictions: None beyond Apache 2.0.

-----------------------------------------------------------------------
2. HIPT-Derivative Components
Includes: Retrained model weights and code derived from Mahmood Lab's HIPT-16/256 models.
License: Apache License 2.0, modified by the Commons Clause below:

Commons Clause Restriction (HIPT)
You may not sell, rent, or commercially exploit the HIPT-Derivative Components without explicit written permission from Mahmood Lab. This restriction applies in addition to Apache 2.0 terms.

Software: HIPT
Licensor: Mahmood Lab

-----------------------------------------------------------------------
3. Original Code
Includes: Code authored by Fabian Hörst and Jens Kleesiek (e.g., segmentation head, training scripts). Including training, inference and postprocessing code (all code
not falling in (1) or (2))

License: Apache License 2.0, modified by the Commons Clause and attribution terms below:

Commons Clause Restriction (Original Code)
You may not sell, rent, or commercially exploit the Original Code without explicit written permission from Fabian Hörst and Jens Kleesiek.

Required Attribution:
If any part of this work is used, you must cite:
